1 lb. white Sugar.



Juice of 6 Lemons.



1 quart Guinness Stout.



1 quart Champagne.



Pour into mixture of Lemon Juice and Sugar the Champagne and Stout, ice

cold. Serve in Punch glasses dressed with Fruit.', NULL, NULL, 'champagne', 'built', NULL, 12, 'unreviewed');
