Drop 3 lumps Cracked Ice in a Rickey (thin Champagne) glass.



1/2 Lime or 1/4 Lemon.



4 dashes Raspberry Syrup.



1 pony Vermouth.



3/4 jigger Gin.



Fill up with Ginger Ale (imported); stir; dress with Fruit and serve.', NULL, NULL, 'champagne', 'stirred', NULL, 12, 'unreviewed');
