Fill large Bar glass 3/4 full Shaved Ice.



1/3 jigger Dry Gin.



1/3 jigger French Vermouth.



1/3 jigger Italian Vermouth.



1 Slice Orange.



Shake well; strain into Cocktail glass and serve.', NULL, NULL, 'cocktail', 'shaken', NULL, 24, 'unreviewed');
