Fill large Bar glass 2/3 full Shaved Ice.



1 teaspoonful Bar Sugar.



3 dashes Lemon Juice.



1 white of an Egg.



1 Wineglass Milk and Cream.



1 jigger Tom Gin.



Shake thoroughly; strain into tall, thin glass; cover the top lightly

with Creme de Menthe and serve.', NULL, 'Original uses raw whole egg; use pasteurized egg for modern preparation.', 'wine', 'shaken', NULL, 14, 'unreviewed');
