Into small Bar glass drop:



3 lumps Ice.



1 tablespoonful Bar Sugar.



1 Egg.



Juice of 1 Lemon.



Shake well; grate Nutmeg on top and serve with Straw.', NULL, 'Original uses raw whole egg; use pasteurized egg for modern preparation.', 'sour', 'shaken', 'grated nutmeg', NULL, 'unreviewed');
