Fill large Bar glass nearly full Shaved Ice.



1 tablespoonful Bar Sugar.



1/4 jigger Whiskey.



1/4 jigger Jamaica Rum.



1/2 jigger Brandy.



1 slice Lemon.



Shake; dress with Fruit and serve with Straws.', NULL, NULL, 'punch', 'shaken', NULL, 18, 'unreviewed');
