Fill large Bar glass 3/4 full Shaved Ice.



2 teaspoonfuls Bar Sugar dissolved in little Water.



1 pony Curacoa.



1 pony Brandy.



1/2 pony Jamaica Hum.



1/2 pony Whiskey.



Shake well; dress with Fruit and serve with Straws.', NULL, NULL, 'bar', 'shaken', NULL, 18, 'unreviewed');
