Lump Ice.



Use Shaker.



1/2 of the white of 1 Egg.



3 dashes Anisette.



1 jigger Old Tom Gin.



1 pony fresh Cream.



Shake well, serve in Cocktail glass.', NULL, 'Original uses raw whole egg; use pasteurized egg for modern preparation.', 'cocktail', 'shaken', NULL, 14, 'unreviewed');
