Use a large Mixing glass; fill with Lump Ice.



1/2 Lime Juice.



1 jigger Burnette''s Old Tom Gin.



2 dashes Imported Grenadine.



Shake well; strain into Cocktail glass and serve.', NULL, NULL, 'cocktail', 'shaken', NULL, 24, 'unreviewed');
