Use a large Brandy Roller glass.



Fill Roller half full of Fine Ice.



Add 1 pony of Old Brandy.



1 jigger of green Creme de Menthe and serve.', NULL, NULL, 'snifter', 'built', NULL, 18, 'unreviewed');
