(American    style.)
I    glass    of   fine    ice
i   pony  of  absinthe
Wine   glass  of  water.
Shake  the  ingredients  until  the  outside  of  shaker  is
covered  with  ice.
Strain  in  glass  and  serve.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'shaken', NULL, NULL, 'unreviewed');
