I  pound  powdered  sugar,  dissolved  in  sufficient  water
h  pint  brandy
i  pint  peach  brandy
I  pint  Jamaica  rum
4  tablespoons  Angostura  bitters
2\  pints  cold  water.
Ice  and  serve.', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'unreviewed');
