1  tablespoonful  raspberry  syrup
Juice  1  lemon
100%  St.   Croix  rum
2  dashes  Curacao
Fill  glass  with  cracked  ice.
Trim  with  fruits  in  season.
(After    Dinner)', NULL, NULL, NULL, 'built', NULL, NULL, 'unreviewed');
