Coffee-leaf tea
Coffee cherry tea
Ground coffee, brewed in a coffee bag, like bagged tea, is referred to simply as "coffee", and is similar to filter coffee.', 1, 5, 15, NULL, 'drink', 0, 0, NULL, 'Wikipedia (CC BY-SA 4.0)', NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, 'mug', 'brewed', NULL, NULL, 'unreviewed');
