1 fresh peach perforated with fork.

1 pint champagne.

Bishop’s Cup.

Use quart glass pitcher.

1/2 jigger lemon juice.

1 jigger plain syrup.

1 jigger Jamaica rum.

1 pint of claret or red Burgundy.

Dress with fruit and mint.

Bull’s Eye Cup.

