Use largo glass pitcher, into which put:

1 pony brandy.

1 pony brown curagoa.

1 pony maraschino.

1 quart Burgundy.

1 pint sparkling water.

1 long cube ice.

Stir well and decorate with:

1 lemon sliced.

1 orange sliced.

5 or 6 pieces of pineapple.

Maraschino cherries and 1 small bunch of green
mint on top.', NULL, NULL, 'wine', 'stirred', 'mint sprig, cherry', 12, 'unreviewed');
