Fill a pony glass with brandy. Put a whiskey
glass over it, rim down. Reverse the glasses,
holding them tightly together so as to keep
the brandy in the pony glass; then fill the
whiskey glass one-half full of seltzer and draw
out the pony glass very carefully so as to
leave the brandy floating on top of seltzer.

Brandy Scaffa.

% jigger raspberry syrup.

% jigger maraschino.

% jigger chartreuse.

% jigger cognac.', NULL, NULL, 'rocks', 'built', NULL, 18, 'unreviewed');
