1 pony maraschino (Holland).

3 ponies cognac.

1 pony brown Curasao.

1 dash yellow chartreuse.

2 quarts imported champagne.

2 quarts Apollinaris, or any other brand the
customer desires.

Sugar to taste. Fruit.', NULL, NULL, 'punch_bowl', 'built', 'pineapple', 12, 'unreviewed');
